      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "AI/CI/PAT callers cannot create Runs through the public start-run endpoint even when they can authenticate and have valid workspace membership. Cookie-session Run creation works, and BK-39 finish endpoint works with Bearer on an existing Run."
